# Buster Sword: a spell cast without paying its mana cost still pays an optional additional cost chosen (CR 118.9d, 601.2f). The
# Ornithopter (3/4) deals 3; the trigger draws Burst Lightning (MV 1), which Bot1 casts free but kicked: the kicker {4} is paid
# from four Moxen tapped with the trigger on the stack (the fifth stays untapped), so it deals 4 instead of 2. Bot2: 20 - 3 - 4 = 13.

